---
layout: pgt-layout.njk
title: UP PGT English Mock Tests
description: Take Mock Tests 1 to 5 free without login. More mock tests are open to logged-in students.
crumb_label: Mock Tests
pgt_practice_index: true
pgt_practice_hero_title: English Mock Tests
pgt_practice_collection_label: Mock Tests
pgt_resources: true
---
{#- Tests 1–5 are free public files and are never touched by the script.
    Slots 6–60 are login tests and are self-serve-published (rule 17): each card carries
    data-paper-slot, and assets/paper-list.js (slot mode) flips it between "Coming soon" and
    lock/Start from the LIVE paper catalog when the page is opened. What is printed here is the
    build-time picture, kept as the fallback for no-JS, search engines and a failed read. -#}
<section class="pgt-practice-index" aria-labelledby="pgt-practice-index-title">
  <header class="pgt-practice-intro">
    <div>
      <h2 id="pgt-practice-index-title">Choose a mock test</h2>
      <p>Mock Tests 1 to 5 are free for everyone. Log in with a free account to take the other open tests. More tests are coming soon.</p>
    </div>
    <span>60 tests</span>
  </header>
  <div class="pgt-practice-groups"
       data-paper-slots
       data-exam-id="pgt"
       data-kind="mock-test"
       data-prefix="up-pgt-mock-test-"
       data-base="/exams/pgt/up-pgt/mock-tests/"
       data-route="test-{n}/"
       data-label="Mock Test">
    {% for group in pgtMockTestGroups %}
    <details class="pgt-practice-group"{% if loop.first %} open{% endif %}>
      <summary>
        <img class="pgt-practice-group-icon" src="/assets/icons/tabler/stopwatch.svg" alt="" width="28" height="28">
        <span>Tests {{ group.startLabel }}–{{ group.endLabel }}</span>
        <small>10 tests</small>
        <img class="pgt-practice-chevron" src="/assets/icons/feather/chevron-down.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22">
      </summary>
      <div class="pgt-practice-card-grid">
        {% for mockTest in group.tests %}
        {% if mockTest.access == 'free' %}
        <div class="pgt-practice-card">
          <span class="pgt-practice-card-copy"><strong>Mock Test {{ mockTest.label }}</strong><span>90 questions · Free · No login</span></span>
          <a class="agehub-go is-solid" href="{{ mockTest.url }}" aria-label="Start Mock Test {{ mockTest.number }}">Start</a>
        </div>
        {% elif mockTest.live %}
        <div class="pgt-practice-card" data-paper-slot="{{ mockTest.number }}" data-slot-state="live" data-slot-copy="{% if mockTest.questionCount %}{{ mockTest.questionCount }} questions{% endif %}">
          <span class="pgt-practice-card-copy"><strong>Mock Test {{ mockTest.label }}</strong>{% if mockTest.questionCount %}<span>{{ mockTest.questionCount }} questions</span>{% endif %}</span>
          <a class="agehub-go agehub-go-lock" data-guest-only hidden href="/login/?next={{ mockTest.url | urlencode }}" aria-label="Mock Test {{ mockTest.number }} needs a login. Log in to open it." title="Log in to open Mock Test {{ mockTest.number }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="2" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></a>
          <a class="agehub-go is-solid" data-auth-only hidden href="{{ mockTest.url }}">Start</a>
        </div>
        {% else %}
        <a class="pgt-practice-card" data-paper-slot="{{ mockTest.number }}" data-slot-state="soon" data-slot-copy="" href="{{ mockTest.url }}" aria-label="Mock Test {{ mockTest.number }} — coming soon">
          <span class="pgt-practice-card-copy">
            <strong>Mock Test {{ mockTest.label }}</strong>
            <span>Coming soon</span>
          </span>
          <img src="/assets/icons/feather/arrow-right.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24">
        </a>
        {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
<script src="/assets/paper-list.js" defer></script>
